# Wave W17-X (Route 212 — North): pool turf — pool-meadow turf, wet-edge flecks: a wet meadow green carrying dark wet flecks and the rarest pale water-glints, a road’s grass learning the pools’ manners (design: a road learning to be a bog, the sand path drowning into spreading pools). Route 212 — North’s own ground — split from Route 212 — South’s olive bog turf by lightness entire: the North is a meadow getting wet, the South is a bog that finished.
